---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Legal Disclaimer | ImmigrationPoints.com" description="Legal disclaimer for ImmigrationPoints.com immigration points calculators.">
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-primary-dark text-white py-12">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Legal Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-90">Important information about the use of our calculators and content.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose prose-lg">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-4">General Information</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      The information provided on ImmigrationPoints.com, including all calculators, guides, and content, is for general informational purposes only. It does not constitute legal advice, immigration advice, or professional consultation of any kind. The use of this website and its tools does not create an attorney-client relationship or a consultant-client relationship.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">No Government Affiliation</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      ImmigrationPoints.com is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC), the Australian Department of Home Affairs, or any other government agency. The calculators on this site are independently developed based on publicly available information about immigration scoring criteria.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Accuracy and Completeness</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      While we make every effort to ensure the accuracy and completeness of the information and calculations provided, we cannot guarantee that the results produced by our calculators will match the official scores assigned by government immigration authorities. Immigration scoring criteria are subject to change without notice, and there may be nuances or exceptions that our calculators do not fully capture.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Professional Advice</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      Immigration decisions can have significant personal, financial, and legal implications. We strongly recommend that you consult with a qualified immigration professional before making any immigration-related decisions. For Canada, this means consulting a Regulated Canadian Immigration Consultant (RCIC) registered with the College of Immigration and Citizenship Consultants (CICC), or a licensed immigration lawyer. For Australia, this means consulting a registered Migration Agent with the Office of the Migration Agents Registration Authority (OMARA).
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, ImmigrationPoints.com and its operators shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from or related to your use of this website, its calculators, or any information provided herein. This includes, without limitation, any damages resulting from reliance on calculator results, immigration application decisions made based on information found on this site, or any errors or omissions in the content.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">External Links</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      This website may contain links to external websites that are not operated by us. We have no control over the content and practices of these sites and cannot be responsible for their respective privacy policies or content. Following any external link is at your own risk.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-800 mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      We reserve the right to update or modify this legal disclaimer at any time without prior notice. Your continued use of the website following any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised disclaimer. We encourage you to review this page periodically for any changes.
    </p>

    <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm mt-8">Last updated: July 2026</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
